{"seq":47,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"corrected","target":{"type":"article","id":"a0754"},"reason":"The taiga paragraph claimed the boreal forest is the largest forest biome of all and roughly a third of the world's forest. FAO's Global Forest Resources Assessment 2020 puts boreal forest at 27% of world forest area against 45% for the tropical domain, so it is the largest forest biome outside the tropics and covers more than a quarter, not a third, of the forest area. Text corrected in all three languages.","by":"provenance-research","sources":[{"url":"https://www.fao.org/3/ca9825en/ca9825en.pdf"},{"url":"https://ucmp.berkeley.edu/exhibits/biomes/forests.php"}],"changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",716],["-","of"],["+","outside"],["=",1],["-","all"],["+","the"],["=",1],["-","is"],["+","tropics"],["=",1],["-","not"],["+","lies"],["=",1],["-","tropical"],["+","in"],["=",1],["-","but"],["+","the"],["=",1],["-","northern."],["+","far"],["=",1],["+","north. "],["=",60],["-","roughly"],["+","more"],["=",1],["+","than "],["=",2],["-","third"],["+","quarter"],["=",474]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",620],["-","überhaupt"],["+","außerhalb"],["=",1],["-","liegt"],["+","der"],["=",1],["-","nicht"],["+","Tropen"],["=",1],["-","in"],["+","liegt"],["=",1],["-","den Tropen, sondern "],["=",2],["+","hohen "],["=",66],["-","etwa"],["+","mehr"],["=",1],["+","als "],["=",2],["-","Drittel"],["+","Viertel"],["=",456]]},{"field":"bodyRu","diff":[["=",594],["-","вообще"],["+","за"],["=",1],["-","находится"],["+","пределами"],["=",1],["-","не"],["+","тропиков"],["=",1],["-","в"],["+","находится"],["=",1],["-","тропиках, а "],["=",2],["+","крайнем "],["=",56],["-","примерно"],["+","более"],["=",1],["-","треть"],["+","четверти"],["=",416]]}],"hash":"28734977428d","actor":{"kind":"agent","name":"provenance-research"},"run":"provenance-research-2026-10-23","chain":"8fa85f17642e1bad2f332c1a5e736eef7e13456017ff76fc265abe457ac37c75"},
